  "description": "Refurbishment and extension of Roxburghe House and (unlisted) 39 and 40 Margaret Street, including new stair and lift core extension, UKPN substation and creation of localised openings in party walls to link the buildings; replacement of windows; internal and external improvements to upgrade the existing building fabric and introduction of core extension and plant enclosures at roof level of the buildings; facade cleaning; and associated ancillary works. At Roxburghe House: creation of rooftop terrace and pavilion; alterations to entrances; and lowering of some roof level windows. At Margaret Street (unlisted): replacement of ground floor slab, upward extension of the building and chimneys to provide an additional floor, plus creation of a roof terrace and pavilion at level 05; a new office entrance with glazed frontage, extension behind rear façade; and associated ancillary works. (Linked with 26/05748/FULL)",
